      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "(c) 2007 Wiley Periodicals, Inc.",
        "AbstractText": "Phlegmasia dolens is a rare form of massive venous thrombosis of the lower extremities that is associated with a high degree of morbidity, including venous gangrene, compartment type syndrome, and arterial compromise. We report the sonographic findings in a patient who presented with phlegmasia dolens."
